---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Button from '../components/Button.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Full Photoshoot" description="Capture your story with a relaxed 1-hour photoshoot. Includes 80+ edited images, an online gallery, and fast delivery. Perfect for families and couples!">
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="py-20 md:py-28 bg-section-bg">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-5 gap-10 items-center">
          <div class="md:col-span-2">
            <img
              src="https://mellsnap.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/038-Web-1024x683.jpg"
              alt="Family enjoying outdoor photoshoot together"
              class="w-full aspect-[3/4] object-cover"
            />
          </div>
          <div class="md:col-span-3">
            <p class="label mb-4">Full Story Package</p>
            <h1 class="font-cormorant text-4xl md:text-5xl text-primary-text mb-6">
              Full Photoshoot
            </h1>
            <p class="font-cormorant text-3xl text-gold mb-8">£200</p>

            <ul class="space-y-3 font-cormorant text-lg text-secondary-text mb-8">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 448 512">
                  <path d="M384 32C419.3 32 448 60.65 448 96V416C448 451.3 419.3 480 384 480H64C28.65 480 0 451.3 0 416V96C0 60.65 28.65 32 64 32H384zM339.8 211.8C350.7 200.9 350.7 183.1 339.8 172.2C328.9 161.3 311.1 161.3 300.2 172.2L192 280.4L147.8 236.2C136.9 225.3 119.1 225.3 108.2 236.2C97.27 247.1 97.27 264.9 108.2 275.8L172.2 339.8C183.1 350.7 200.9 350.7 211.8 339.8L339.8 211.8z"/>
                </svg>
                1-hour photo session
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 448 512">
                  <path d="M384 32C419.3 32 448 60.65 448 96V416C448 451.3 419.3 480 384 480H64C28.65 480 0 451.3 0 416V96C0 60.65 28.65 32 64 32H384zM339.8 211.8C350.7 200.9 350.7 183.1 339.8 172.2C328.9 161.3 311.1 161.3 300.2 172.2L192 280.4L147.8 236.2C136.9 225.3 119.1 225.3 108.2 236.2C97.27 247.1 97.27 264.9 108.2 275.8L172.2 339.8C183.1 350.7 200.9 350.7 211.8 339.8L339.8 211.8z"/>
                </svg>
                80+ professionally edited digital images
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 448 512">
                  <path d="M384 32C419.3 32 448 60.65 448 96V416C448 451.3 419.3 480 384 480H64C28.65 480 0 451.3 0 416V96C0 60.65 28.65 32 64 32H384zM339.8 211.8C350.7 200.9 350.7 183.1 339.8 172.2C328.9 161.3 311.1 161.3 300.2 172.2L192 280.4L147.8 236.2C136.9 225.3 119.1 225.3 108.2 236.2C97.27 247.1 97.27 264.9 108.2 275.8L172.2 339.8C183.1 350.7 200.9 350.7 211.8 339.8L339.8 211.8z"/>
                </svg>
                5-7 days delivery
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 448 512">
                  <path d="M384 32C419.3 32 448 60.65 448 96V416C448 451.3 419.3 480 384 480H64C28.65 480 0 451.3 0 416V96C0 60.65 28.65 32 64 32H384zM339.8 211.8C350.7 200.9 350.7 183.1 339.8 172.2C328.9 161.3 311.1 161.3 300.2 172.2L192 280.4L147.8 236.2C136.9 225.3 119.1 225.3 108.2 236.2C97.27 247.1 97.27 264.9 108.2 275.8L172.2 339.8C183.1 350.7 200.9 350.7 211.8 339.8L339.8 211.8z"/>
                </svg>
                Secure online gallery
              </li>
            </ul>

            <Button href="/free-consultation/" variant="primary">
              Book a Free Consultation
            </Button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Introduction -->
  <section class="py-20 md:py-28 bg-white">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <p class="font-cormorant text-xl text-secondary-text leading-relaxed mb-6">
          If you're looking for a more relaxed photography experience, my <strong class="text-primary-text">Full Story Photo Package</strong> is just for you. With plenty of time to capture those genuine smiles and moments, this package is perfect for creating a full gallery of memories.
        </p>
        <p class="font-cormorant text-xl text-secondary-text leading-relaxed">
          Whether you're celebrating a family milestone, marking a special occasion, or simply updating your photo collection, the Full Story package gives us the time and space to explore your favourite location, try different setups, and truly tell your story through beautiful, natural images.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Featured Image -->
  <section class="bg-section-bg">
    <div class="container py-10">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <img
          src="https://www.mellsnap.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/088-Web-1024x683.jpg"
          alt="Family picnic in a park celebrating baby's first birthday"
          class="w-full aspect-[3/2] object-cover"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- What's Included -->
  <section class="py-20 md:py-28 bg-white">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="font-cormorant text-3xl md:text-4xl text-primary-text mb-8">
          What's Included in My Full Story Photo Package?
        </h2>
        <p class="font-cormorant text-xl text-secondary-text mb-8">
          Here's what you'll get with this flexible and relaxed session:
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-4 font-cormorant text-lg text-secondary-text">
          <li><strong class="text-primary-text">A 1-hour photoshoot</strong> – Enough time to settle in, try different ideas, and create a variety of gorgeous shots.</li>
          <li><strong class="text-primary-text">80+ professionally edited digital images</strong> – A full gallery of polished, high-quality photos to treasure forever.</li>
          <li><strong class="text-primary-text">5–7 day delivery</strong> – You won't have to wait long to enjoy your photos.</li>
          <li><strong class="text-primary-text">Secure online gallery</strong> – Your photos are delivered in a private gallery for easy viewing, sharing, and downloading, and they are active for up to one month.</li>
          <li><strong class="text-primary-text">Natural and soft edit</strong> – Each image is carefully cropped and framed, with gentle, natural edits of the colours, lighting and white balance, there are no harsh filters or heavy retouching.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Why Choose -->
  <section class="py-20 md:py-28 bg-section-bg">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="font-cormorant text-3xl md:text-4xl text-primary-text mb-8">
          Why Choose the Full Story Photo Package?
        </h2>
        <p class="font-cormorant text-xl text-secondary-text mb-10">
          Sometimes, you need a little more time to relax, enjoy the process, and let the magic unfold naturally. This package gives us the flexibility to capture a wide range of photos – from playful, candid moments to beautifully composed portraits.
        </p>

        <div class="space-y-8">
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-cormorant text-2xl text-primary-text mb-3">1. Relaxed and Unhurried</h3>
            <p class="font-cormorant text-lg text-secondary-text">
              With a full hour to work together, there's no need to rush. We can take our time exploring your chosen location, letting everyone settle in and feel comfortable in front of the camera.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="font-cormorant text-2xl text-primary-text mb-3">2. Plenty of Variety</h3>
            <p class="font-cormorant text-lg text-secondary-text">
              An hour-long session gives us the chance to capture a mix of group shots, individual portraits, and those in-between candid moments that make your gallery truly special and unique.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="font-cormorant text-2xl text-primary-text mb-3">3. Perfect for Families and Couples</h3>
            <p class="font-cormorant text-lg text-secondary-text">
              Whether it's playing with the kids, sharing a laugh with your partner, or simply enjoying a moment together, the Full Story package is perfect for capturing genuine connections.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="font-cormorant text-2xl text-primary-text mb-3">4. High-Quality Results</h3>
            <p class="font-cormorant text-lg text-secondary-text">
              With over 80 beautifully edited high-quality images delivered, you'll have a full story of your session to look back on – perfect for creating photo albums, prints, or wall art.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Who Is This For -->
  <section class="py-20 md:py-28 bg-white">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="font-cormorant text-3xl md:text-4xl text-primary-text mb-8">
          Who Is This Package For?
        </h2>
        <p class="font-cormorant text-xl text-secondary-text mb-8">
          I designed the Full Story package for anyone who wants to take their time and enjoy a complete photography experience:
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-4 font-cormorant text-lg text-secondary-text">
          <li><strong class="text-primary-text">Families</strong> – From toddlers playing in the park to cosy moments at home, we'll capture the love and joy of your family.</li>
          <li><strong class="text-primary-text">Couples</strong> – A romantic hour together, filled with laughter, connection, and beautiful portraits.</li>
          <li><strong class="text-primary-text">Celebrations</strong> – Perfect for anniversaries, engagements, or maternity sessions.</li>
          <li><strong class="text-primary-text">Anyone</strong> – If you want a full gallery of stunning images to treasure forever, this is the package for you.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="py-20 md:py-28 bg-beige">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
        <h2 class="font-cormorant text-4xl md:text-5xl text-primary-text mb-6">
          Ready to Book Your Full Story Session?
        </h2>
        <p class="font-cormorant text-xl text-secondary-text mb-10">
          Let's take our time and create something truly special together.
        </p>
        <Button href="/free-consultation/" variant="primary">
          Book a Free Consultation
        </Button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
